# From Saplings Grow (windurst 85): its Perih Vashai lines next to his own script (the reply kinds). A level-75 RNG at
# Archery 2500 holding the Bow of Trials; Sin Hunting and The Fanged One completed by GM, Fire and Brimstone available:
# his script answers 531 (Fire and Brimstone offered), then 532 (fireAndBrimstone 1). An NPC with a script alternates
# it with Event-priority lines (UseFallback): after an Event the script goes first on the next talk; a Progress line
# (or a turn after the script) goes first. Available: 661 (an Event) plays (the handler system's turn), begun. Accepted:
# his script's 531 (an Event was last), Fire and Brimstone accepted; 662 (his turn after the script); his script's 532;
# 662 again; the Annals of Truth by GM: 666 (Progress) on the script's turn, completed.
lists WindurstWoods/Perih_Vashai/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/661 WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/662 WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/666
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=119.5,-3.7,90.45 job=RNG lvl=75
quest Windurst.SinHunting completed
quest Windurst.TheFangedOne completed
skill Archery 2500
item BowOfTrials wsp=0
login
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # available: 661 (an Event), the handler system first
finish                                        # the bow held: the guide, begun
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # accepted, 661 was an Event: his script first, 531 (a Progress 661 would give 662)
finish                                        # his script: Fire and Brimstone accepted, fireAndBrimstone 1
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # after the script: 662 (0, bow, 0, 0, 2)
finish option=0                               # nothing
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # 662 was an Event: his script's 532
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # 662 again
finish option=0
keyitem AnnalsOfTruth                         # GM
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # 666 (Progress) on the script's turn (an Event 666 would give 532)
finish                                        # completed
